<section class="story">
  <div class="h-container">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-image" role="img" aria-label="Hector at work in his shop"></div>
      <div>
        <span class="h-section-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 24px; display: block;">The Hector story</span>
        <h2 class="story-h2 h-display">
          From a kid washing cars<br />
          <em>to the shop locals trust.</em>
        </h2>
        <p class="story-body">
          Almost thirty years ago, Hector started as an employee at another local car wash. He worked his way up to management — learning every detail of the craft, from the chemistry of soap to the way light reflects off a properly waxed hood.
        </p>
        <p class="story-body">
          When he was ready, he left to build something better. Hector's Car Wash opened with one simple promise: every car gets the care he'd give his own. That promise is still what makes the difference, three locations later.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="story-quote">
          The real treat is all the cars that roll by while you wait. Bentleys, Aston Martins, Mercedes — Hector's is where Palm Beach takes its finest.
          <cite>— Nico, Local Guide · Google Reviews</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: var(--color-cream-warm);
  }
  .story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .story-image {
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-navy) 0%, var(--color-charcoal-soft) 100%);
    position: relative;
  }
  .story-image::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(250, 247, 242, 0.4);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .story-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 50px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  .story-body {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-charcoal-soft);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .story-body:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .story-quote {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold);
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }
  .story-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-gray-warm);
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .story-image { aspect-ratio: 16/10; max-width: 500px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .story { padding: 72px 0; }
  }
</style>
